// NOTE: Architecture & Transformer+P4 / random baseline are implemented in C (internal/runtime/qadav_nn.c).
// Transformer v3 Baseline: supports both Random Policy and Transformer + P4 Rollout Planning
network TransformerV3NoPlan ⟦
    dense ⟬128⸴ 256⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬256⸴ 128⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "TRANSFORMER_V3_NOPLAN_BASELINE" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧

